<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114275" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοινικ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nave</i> of a wheel, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18(2).479
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1234
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.104
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>trepan,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cels.
				8.3.1
			</span></i> (acc. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εικίδα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.448
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.126
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>ring</i> forming the stand for a crown, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				22.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.180
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοῖνιξ</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				4.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>cave in a rocky shore,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.3.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			<i>box</i> or <i>socket for the hinge of a door,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1672.201
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11(2).165.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				287
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				102
			</span></i>, al. (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VII.</b>
			<i>axle-box,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				11.2
			</span></i>, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				176.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χνόαι.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VIII.</b> in torsion-engines,
				<i>box</i> or <i>hub</i> containing strands of gut, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				63.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				60.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				96.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IX.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χνόη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				96.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				117
			</span></i>.</div>
